  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "David at Nob",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David went to Nob, to Ahimelek the priest. Ahimelek trembled when he met him, and asked, \"Why are you alone? Why is no one with you?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David answered Ahimelek the priest, \"The king sent me on a mission and said to me, 'No one is to know anything about the mission I am sending you on.' As for my men, I have told them to meet me at a certain place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now then, what do you have on hand? Give me five loaves of bread, or whatever you can find.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the priest answered David, \"I don't have any ordinary bread on hand; however, there is some consecrated bread here—provided the men have kept themselves from women.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David replied, \"Indeed women have been kept from us, as usual whenever",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "I set out. The men's bodies are holy even on missions that are not holy. How much more so today!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the priest gave him the consecrated bread, since there was no bread there except the bread of the Presence that had been removed from before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.21.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and replaced by hot bread on the day it was taken away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now one of Saul's servants was there that day, detained before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.21.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; he was Doeg the Edomite, Saul's chief shepherd.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David asked Ahimelek, \"Don't you have a spear or a sword here? I haven't brought my sword or any other weapon, because the king's mission was urgent.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest replied, \"The sword of Goliath the Philistine, whom you killed in the Valley of Elah, is here; it is wrapped in a cloth behind the ephod. If you want it, take it; there is no sword here but that one.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 21:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "David said, \"There is none like it; give it to me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "David at Gath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That day David fled from Saul and went to Achish king of Gath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the servants of Achish said to him, \"Isn't this David, the king of the land? Isn't he the one they sing about in their dances:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "1SA 21:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'Saul has slain his thousands,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "1SA 21:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and David his tens of thousands'?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David took these words to heart and was very much afraid of Achish king of Gath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he pretended to be insane in their presence; and while he was in their hands he acted like a madman, making marks on the doors of the gate and letting saliva run down his beard.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achish said to his servants, \"Look at the man! He is insane! Why bring him to me?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am I so short of madmen that you have to bring this fellow here to carry on like this in front of me? Must this man come into my house?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1SA.22",
    "number": "22",
    "bookId": "1SA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "1SA.20",
    "number": "20",
    "bookId": "1SA"
  }
}